OL,5,G1200 Inside the Ambulance
OL,6,     FParamedics are called to a
OL,7,     F67-year-old with a lung condition
OL,8,     Fwho can't breathe. Plus, crews
OL,9,     Fhelp a 53-year-old who's had
OL,10,     Fseveral seizures.
OL,11,G1230 Inside the Ambulance
OL,12,     FParamedics are sent to help a
OL,13,     Fwoman whose foot was run over by a
OL,14,     Fbin lorry, and a team is sent to
OL,15,     Fassess a man suffering from an
OL,16,     Fagonizing headache that has been
OL,17,     Fgoing on for days.
