OL,11,G1330 Inside the Ambulance
OL,12,     FIn Dudley, a man collapses while
OL,13,     Fplaying bingo two days before his
OL,14,     Fwedding, while in Stoke, crews are
OL,15,     Fcalled to help an elderly man who
OL,16,     Fhas had an unexplained fall.
